  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 200eb (Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1<br>\n<strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons without a Smartgun Link or Smart Rebuild</p>\n<p>Toggle on or off as an Action. While on, the weapon counts as Excellent Quality (situational +1), but you take -2 to Stealth (-4 against infrared/nightvision or LL/IR/UV cyberware). Poor Quality weapons still jam on a 1. On an already Excellent Quality weapon you can instead paint a target (an Action, or part of a Ranged Attack Action): until your next Turn, anyone who can see the laser gets a +1 Complementary Bonus to hit that target. Not on weapons with a Smartgun Link or Smart Rebuild. Can't be combined with an IR/UV Laser Sight.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Scopes &amp; Sights).</em></p>"
